# aprilcam.proto -- generated protobuf / gRPC stubs for the AprilCam v2
# daemon control plane.
#
# Output, not source: aprilcam_v2_pb2.py and aprilcam_v2_pb2_grpc.py are
# regenerated by scripts/compile_proto.py from proto/aprilcam_v2.proto
# (project root) -- never hand-edit them. This is sprint 020's
# deliberately narrow four-RPC subset (ListCameras, ProbeCameras,
# GetFrame, GetStatus); see proto/aprilcam_v2.proto's header for why it
# is a subset and not a placeholder, and docs/design/design.md §6's
# "Proto boundary" convention that only daemon/rpc.py (server side) and
# the future client/models.py (client side, ticket 020-005) import
# these generated types directly.
